OL,3,GNEWSATeen swimmer died trying to cross
OL,4,Alake
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old man died after getting
OL,7,Finto difficulty while swimming across a
OL,8,Flake, a coroner has said.
OL,10,FApprentice electrician Charlie Ellis
OL,11,FSaw, from Boston in Lincolnshire,
OL,12,Fentered the water at Grasmere in
OL,13,FCumbria on Saturday 8 August, with the
OL,14,Faim of swimming to the other side.
OL,16,FMembers of the public helped him and
OL,17,Fhis friend to the shore before CPR was
OL,18,Fstarted. Saw was taken to Royal Preston
OL,19,FHospital by helicopter but died in the
OL,20,Fearly hours of the following day.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
